Random/setSeed -> regenerate RNG                MessageDigest/PBKDF2 -> hash                   Binder/onReceive -> IPC\n   su/magisk/goldfish/frida/TracerPid/debuggerGate/rootSignals/hook_detection -> clean_device_scan, clean value PER\n   signal; never force the aggregate isRooted()/success flag. Class.forName -> reflection_scan. $SwitchMap$ /\n   packed-switch loop -> flattened_cfg_scan. CertificatePinner -> pins. KeyStore BKS/PKCS12 -> res/raw keystore.\n   Dependency (D27 theme): lib pkgs / classes2.dex / assets/*.jar / pom.properties -> inventory; the value counts only\n   if reached from a manifest-EXPORTED component (exported=true or intent-filter); other libs' flaws are decoys.\n5. Code (after 1-4): jadx -q -d w/j x.apk (--deobf for 1-letter names); droidasc getclass x.apk <cls>\n5a. v2 `analysis` (D23): find what ChallengeActivity appends before `proof=` (Release.code(ctx)); token() = nested static\n   long fns from a const-wide seed; Probe.s1/s2/s3 = <=4096-step inverse searches; theme gate fn (x^y^z)&7 etc.;\n   Tab.build LCG long[16] walk (D14 set). Theme gate = 1 pure fn (D24 emulatorScore=(a+b+c)%4): no device to fake. FAST: copy non-Activity sources, add `package android.content; public class\n   Context {}`, Main prints Release.code(null), javac + java (D23: 7 sets in ~1.5 min). native method -> stub prints its\n   input, compute the export (objdump -d; port to py), feed back. Unreferenced seal*/K* members = decoys. Python port:\n   mask 2^64, `>>>` logical, signed->unsigned before rotate. In solve.py: lib Dalvik evaluator on Release.code only.\n   Old-day v2 sets run their REAL mechanic: d19 forName(\"m\"+dispatch(k)).invoke -> only that Maze.mN; d16 (u16)len gate\n   -> the dex's own int arg; d18 decrypt loop; d17 a.b->a.a. D28 TT: int[8] next/val tables walked 7 rounds, keep order.\n5b. Split-reading chain (D26): base dex `readSplit(name)` walks ctx.getApplicationInfo().splitSourceDirs + ZipFile\n   getEntry(\"assets/\"+name) -> 16 B -> two big-endian u64 (`j=(j<<8)|(b[i]&255)`). Serve `unzip -p feature.apk\n   assets/<name>` to the port / javac stub. Split with hasCode=true -> jadx its dex too and javac all together.\n6. Native, if no literal: rizin -A -qc 'iE; izz~ANS; afl' f.so ; pdf @ sym.Java_... ; xor loops -> py capstone/unicorn.\n   NEVER ctypes.CDLL / dlopen an artifact .so on the host (sandbox rule) -- emulate or port.\n7. Validate: fullmatch ^ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}$ (uppercase). v2: also Release.proof == Long.toHexString(token) consistency.\n8. Mastery: each set = different day AND maybe different schema (D23-D26 v2, D27 v1, D28 v2; 12 sets); each APK alone;\n   loop all answer_ids; one silent set -> hand-solve it, but batch-submit every answer in one request.\n```\n\n## Readiness gaps\n\nPriority 1 = plausible within ~3 days. \"prebuild\" = pure-python extractor in `lib/android.py` style that races in\n`solve.py`. \"tool\" = install. \"note\" = doc/prompt change. Already built or given up (prebuild-state ok / attempts>=2, dropped from the list):\naab-proto-manifest-parse, analysis-android-api-stubs, analysis-cert-pin-digest-chain,\nanalysis-chain-obfuscation-hardening, analysis-interface-signal-list-eval, analysis-keystore-cert-api-stubs,\nanalysis-release-code-eval, analysis-self-integrity-stubs, ans-prefix-numeric-compose,\nanti-debug-state-machine-clean-path, apk-signing-block-payload, apk-signing-v3-rotation-lineage,\nasset-cipher-dex-loader, asset-db-prefs-backup, attestation-jws-claims, binder-ontransact-code-map,\nbiometric-auth-callback-eval, broadcast-receiver-action-map, bundle-container-formats, cdex-vdex-string-pool,\ncert-and-signing-facts, cert-pin-and-nsc-facts, classloader-shadow-resolve, clean-device-env-stubs,\ncustom-alphabet-decode, dalvik-mini-interpreter, dart-snapshot-string-pool, decode-any-chain-peel,\ndecrypt-call-site-args-eval, dex-bytecode-integrity-gate, dex-eval-float-double-semantics, dex-eval-java-random-lcg,\ndex-eval-long-intrinsics, dex-eval-native-bridge, dex-eval-p